    <h2>What it isn't</h2>

    <p>It isn't a CRM and it isn't going to turn into one. It doesn't take payments, doesn't chase invoices, and doesn't do anything with a customer list. It prices a job and hands over an estimate. If one of your contractors already runs software that does the rest, this sits next to it and doesn't argue.</p>

    <p>And I don't sell them prices. Every number in there is theirs. I'm not putting a parts catalog in front of your customers with my markup on it &mdash; that's your business, not mine.</p>

